    "turn_text": "I want to ask you something. I mean, I want. Look, I watch, I'm a news junkie. I know what's going on based on what I've seen on television, Fox News, listening to Sean. You've been at the border. A lot of people, because they're preoccupied with going to work, putting food on the table, taking care of their kids, they don't know. And for political reasons, that information is not really getting out to all Americans. The Democrats are making noise because this Problem with the southern border has now affected their cities. They're doing the song and dance, trips down to the border. Can you break it down to the American people? The seriousness of what's going on at the southern border?",
