    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/8/48231.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 49,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, look, as an American is a career official that served this country for 40 years under six administrations, both Republican and Democrat, I had to come to the logical rash conclusion that I didn't want to believe. Leo, I did not want to believe, but here's what it is. There's a perceived political benefit to their open borders on two fronts. One is that, remember, illegal aliens are counted as part of the census. So there's a very real possibility of redistricting in the Democrats' favor. The second perceived benefit is they believe every single illegal alien, they find a pathway to citizenship is going to equate to democratic vote. They have jeopardized our nation's safety and national security for politics. This is disgusting, and you just played that montage. And I'll give you another stat of why they're lying. In the 12-month period, 100,000 Americans died from drug overdose or fentanyl poisoning, and we know it comes from our wide open Southwest border. So we know 1.6 million known godly with potential necessary threats and criminals as well as drugs pointed, and they lie, and say, are border secure. And you know what the other light real quick is? They say that walls are ineffective and don't work. Well, guess what? Every man and woman in the United States border to all 20,000 of them. If you ask, do always work as part of a multi-layer strategy. Every single woman will say they work. This secretary and this entire administration lines American people.",
