ked for anyone as a lawyer. I would have been fired. I wasn't going to kiss butt. And the great thing about Fox News for me, I'm just speaking for myself. I'm not gonna lie to you. No one's an alien old, tone it down. Don't say that. No one's ever told me that. And so I'm in a very good comfort zone. And like I said to you, I'm a Trump supporter. If you watch me on Fox News, I yell and scream, I am a Trump supporter. And there are people who may have a different opinion about Fox, but as far as I'm concerned, When you watch Leo 2.0 on Fox News, or Fox Business, or Fox Nation, you're getting the real Leo 2.0. Nothing filtered, nothing muffled, and I love this country. Sounds corny, but I love this country. And I'm working 24-7 to get President Trump elected. What's my evidence? Look at the streets. Look at the southern border. Those 13 American soldiers who were murdered in Afghanistan, I'll never forget that to me is horrific. That's why I'm working 24 seven for President Trump. And before he came on, you might recall, like I said again, that's called loyalty. If you love your country and trust me, nobody's going to sell me, you know, a bag of coal. I am committed to Trump because he cares about this country. I'm not out to benefit or to serve some Democrat or Republican elites. I want this country to become great again. And I see that in President Trump. Okay, our number three coming up. We got a special guest. I've been looking for this guy for a long time. So stay tuned for the Sean Hannity show. And let me tell you right now, we're going to take a lot of calls. Rob, I want to thank you for that call. I see the phones. Many of you want to, you know, opine in this final hour. You're going to hear, I'm going to hear from you. Okay, this is Sean Hannity radio program 1-800-941-SHON-1-800-941-SHON. If you want to talk to Leo 2.0, call it right now. I guarantee you'll get on. We'll be right back.",
